<p>What kind of person is this artist?<br />
-He is a very cheerful and friendly, yet shown to be dangerous and even malicious</p>
<p>Does he know how to use his anomalous abilities?<br />
-Yes, he does. In an incident report, that I have in mind, I imagine that he used his creation to escape containment&#8230;</p>
<p>-The abilities that I have in mind for him include<br />
1-Giving life to his creations and controlling them<br />
2-He also has a bag that seems to be some kind of ''pocket dimension'', where he pulls out different art supplies<br />
3-He also produces a black ink like substance that is what allows his anomalous properties in the first place, he might be able to sort of teleport using his powers<br />
4-He can also access or enter drawings or pull stuff out of them</p>
<p>The reason that he can do so much stuff is that he has lived for a long time and learned how to sculpt and draw overtime</p>
<p>Is this good? What could be changed or bettered?</p>

